    "group": "Burna‑bommer",
    "summary": "As the opponent’s [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, choose one visible enemy within 36″ of the Burna-bommer. Exclude **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** units and [Lone Operatives](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative). Roll one D6. On a 2+, the chosen unit takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**. It also loses access to Hidden until your next turn ends. Ranged attacks against it get [[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover) for that same period.",
